# agent-graph-budgets

> **Purpose:** Keep the agent predictable in time, cost and shape.
>
> **Applies to:** `apps/api/src/agent/**`

## Graph shape
- Keep the fixed graph: stages 0 to 8, one conditional retry edge.
- Do not add stages, edges or agents without updating `docs/agent-architecture.md`.
- One file per stage in `src/agent/nodes/`. Graph wiring lives in `src/agent/graph.ts`.

## Model vs code
- Call the AI model only in `plan`, `extract` and the `verify` support check, which can only downgrade a label (D24).
- `resolve`, `score` and `save` are plain, tested code. `verify` is plain code too, apart from its one support check, which may only remove a label.
- Use the fast model for `plan` and the strong model for `extract`. Use a low temperature.

## Budgets
- Max 120 seconds per run, 8 pages (4 on the first pass), 1 retry.
- Check the budget before each stage.
- When time runs out, save a partial guide. Never crash the run.

## Events
- Emit `stage.started` and `stage.done` for every stage.
- Emit claim events from `verify` only.
- Type every event with `@stamp/schema`.
